# Astra V2 challenge: planning and acceptance

Date: 2026-09-05. Request: "letme see astras ceuiling" following the V1 critique.

This is a stronger bounded design demonstration, not a claim to an absolute model ceiling. Preserve all V1 artifacts unchanged. No engine, inventory, governance, backend, or configuration edits; no new pipeline scripts, commits, purchases, or physical blending.

## Decision to make

Select the best-supported NEXT DEVELOPMENT HYPOTHESIS for the public Prada L'Homme Intense arc: floral iris against amber and patchouli, an airy/roasted tonka register, and sandalwood support. Brand notes support an architecture, not a proprietary ingredient list or proportions. Leather is optional texture, not a verified public anchor.

## Bounded work

1. Freeze source hashes and live stock authority. Keep the independent functional ideal separate from the stock-mapped build. Record every predecessor-row disposition and every deliberate product-dose change.
2. One read-only Astra challenger, requested at host `ultra`, develops exactly three architectures: a compressed identity control and two developed alternatives. No child workers. Parent verifies and owns all dose decisions, edits, and acceptance.
3. Investigate only decision-changing diagnostic issues: weighed-mass/volume conversion; Bacdanol and Ambrettolide VP disagreement; Heliotropal/Orivone threshold provenance; explicit Intense reference metadata. Do not alter shared data to obtain a PASS.
4. Compare candidates at equal named-product mass and matched declared carrier/final-mass conditions on paper. These are not observed sensory comparisons. Prefer an interpretable coherent hypothesis; do not invent a numerical quality ranking.
5. Write an independent ideal with option decisions and ranges, a complete V2 stock-mapped mass formula, source-lineage/dose ledger, and a basket card. A compressed research control is not promoted as equal/better complexity. Preserve V1's 18-row source floor in a developed successor unless an explicit compression disposition is accepted; row count alone proves nothing.
6. Use existing mass-aware facilities if supported; otherwise expose any model-coordinate projection as nonphysical and assert its per-material product-mass algebra. Never label modeled coordinates as pipetting instructions. Run one integrated final diagnostic plus the required formatter; preserve any failed gates. Add bounded analytical sensitivity and arithmetic checks rather than repeated broad suites.
7. Deliver the candidate, exact accounting, verbatim formatter output in chat and formula, and decisive blinded comparisons. Keep unverified stock bindings, reference contracts, safety, sensory quality, stability, and physical performance on HOLD/NOT TESTED.

## Predetermined acceptance

- Three genuinely distinguishable design hypotheses; no claim that their sensory outcomes are known.
- Independent ideal is not a normalization of the current stock table.
- Every retained product owns a distinct target-linked function and a falsifiable omission/alternative comparison; ambiguous ownership is disclosed.
- Parent and successor totals close exactly, carriers stay separate from supplied fragrant products, and no milligram is relabeled as an authoritative microliter.
- Diagnostic claims are robustly limited by property provenance and matrix assumptions; no OAV-to-perceived-share or modeled-hours-to-skin-life promotion.
- Existing V1, repository tracked bytes, and governance hashes are preserved. Final artifact hashes and focused assertion results are recorded.

Status at creation: planning complete; research and independent challenge in progress. Native worker request accepted; actual runtime effort receipt still to verify.

## Completion record

The bounded challenge completed. Parent selected source-preserving B18; the worker's smaller B remains a controlled deletion hypothesis. A is the exact ten-product research control; C is an independent darker/balsamic ideal with unresolved stock mapping. V2's mass master, 18 independent ideal decisions, full predecessor ledger, basket card, equal-loading/carrier-matched experiment and both verbatim diagnostic reports are written.

One initial integrated run and one justified artifact-label correction rerun were needed: `neat / as supplied` was unrecognized, so the diagnostic now uses supported `neat`. All first-run inputs and outputs are preserved. Numeric headspace states were identical across the correction; no dose, shared code, stock pin or scientific property changed. G15 compares the immediate unchanged V1 mass recipe through its explicitly nonphysical parent projection. Additional work was limited to algebraic verification, a target-neutral deep-plane check and one-factor property sensitivity.

Runtime evidence: one Astra review was requested at `ultra` and completed; the collaboration receipt does not expose executed effort. No absolute model-ceiling claim is made. All design/sensory/safety/release promotion remains bounded by the final receipts and physical evidence still missing.
